  <metadata>
    <name>day-3-adishi-iprali</name>
    <desc>Published trail split into daily stages. Day 2 uses the lower Adishi trail. Lodging access paths and transfers are not included. Not a live trail-condition report.</desc>
    <link href="https://www.caucasus-trekking.com/treks/trek-mestia-to-ushguli">
      <text>Caucasus Trekking: source track and route description</text>
    </link>
